hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1141","On the authority of Saeed bin Abdul Rahman Al Makhzoumi, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Mansour, on the authority of Ibrahim, on the authority of Abdul Rahman bin Yazid, on the authority of Alqamah On the authority of Abu Masoud Al-Ansari, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Whoever recites the two verses from the end of Surat Al-Baqarah on the night of \It's enough for him\"""""
